<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on nine German stocks.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on nine German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities GmbH has issued American-style call warrants of one million per tranche on shares of nine German stocks.</p>
<p>The stocks are Adidas AG, BASF AG, Bayer AG, Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG (BMW), Commerzbank AG, Daimler-Benz AG, Degussa AG, Deutsche Bank AG and Deutsche Telecom AG.</p>
<p>The maturity date for the warrants is December 1, 1998 and the payment date is April 1, 1997. They are all listed on the Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges and available in exercise lots of 100.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
